                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 892.001/12.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Chargé Tarler to the
                            Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bangkok</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1910-11-14"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">November 14,
                    1910</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>His Majesty the King of Siam has been crowned. I was received in private
                    audience.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Tarler.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
